## Architecture design (1B dense-equivalent MoE)

**Parameters:** `num_layers=24`, `hidden_size=2048`, `ffn_mult=2.0` (expert FFN = 4096), `vocab=32000`, `seq_len=2048`

| Component | Dense | MoE (16×) | Activated (top-2) |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Attention (24 layers) | 403M | 403M | 403M |
| Expert FFNs | 604M | 9,664M | 1,208M |
| Embedding | 65.5M | 65.5M | 65.5M |
| Layernorms | 0.1M | 0.1M | 0.1M |
| **Total** | **1.07B** | **10.13B** | **1.68B** |

- **Routing:** Top-2 (training default; quality blend at modest all-to-all cost), **capacity factor 1.25** (absorbs imbalance), **aux loss 0.01** (prevents router collapse).
- **FLOPs:** 10.46 GFLOPs/token (`6×activated + 4×24×2048×2048`).
- **Memory (per GPU):** params 5.8GB + grads 5.8GB + AdamW-mixed 34.7GB + activations (recomputed) 4.0GB + overhead ≈ **57GB** → ~29% headroom on 80GB.
- **Throughput:** ≈95k tokens/sec at ~40% MFU on 8×A100-80GB.

